I just skimmed the ACTFL guidelines.

They seem too nebulous and imprecise to be used on their own.  They could
serve as guidelines for creating the levels, but given that I can't imagine
it taking more than a week (at about 5-10 minutes a day) of glancing at
dictionary definitions of relevant words to get to the novice-high level, I
feel some adjustments would need to be made.

